<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xerox started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xerox started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Xerox Corp as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Xerox closed Friday at 74-7/8.</p>
</text>
